MARK MANDEL: Let's go to that.

00:03:37.070 --> 00:03:38.445
MELANIE WARRICK:
This week, we're

00:03:38.445 --> 00:03:40.940
excited to have join
us Cassie Kozyrkov who

00:03:40.940 --> 00:03:42.020
is one of our teammates.

00:03:42.020 --> 00:03:45.320
And she's here today to talk to
