post, which is kind of great.

00:37:31.020 --> 00:37:33.550
Is that this is not really
a practical use of it

00:37:33.550 --> 00:37:36.390
but if you have application
credentials on your laptop

00:37:36.390 --> 00:37:38.550
that you wanted
to try encrypting

00:37:38.550 --> 00:37:41.190
with the YubiKey or smart card--

00:37:41.190 --> 00:37:43.140
the GPG smart card
is the YubiKey

00:37:43.140 --> 00:37:45.280
is my understanding
