encryption and tells you

00:37:50.580 --> 00:37:53.070
where to find the different
files and what files to change.

00:37:53.070 --> 00:37:54.300
And we'll include
that link for those

00:37:54.300 --> 00:37:56.520
who might be curious to
explore this and experiment

00:37:56.520 --> 00:37:59.145
